<div id="A6.SS4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A6.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ F.4 Sensitivity of Kuiper Statistic to Effort Measure ‣ Appendix F Formal Definition of Metrics ‣ Appendix ‣ Strategic Navigation or Stochastic Search?How Agents and Humans Reason Over Document Collections" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> shows the resulting Kuiper statistics under each effort definition. For the six systems above, Kuiper values vary by at most 20% across metrics, confirming that the calibration assessment is robust to effort definition choice.</p>
</div>
