                 <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{results}\leftarrow\textsc{Search}(\mathcal{I},\textit{query},k)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">results</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">Search</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">query</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{results}\leftarrow\textsc{Search}(\mathcal{I},\textit{query},k)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l15.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Returns (file, page) tuples
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
